# P12 round 6: Synth order on the Tracker Mini, Mini keys only (the MK66 edit mode of the Model list, docs/synth_order.md). Instr held + Up x3 picks Synth 1,
# Menu box 1 (Instrument Parameters) opens the Synth screen, Shift + F1 starts the edit mode ("Edit list"), the cursor starts on WTFM (Synth 1's engine), Down puts it
# on PERC, Shift + Down moves PERC below DIRT, Up goes to DIRT, Delete hides it, Up goes to WTFM, Delete hides it too, F1 leaves. The card
# has a /Plugins folder, so every change is written to /Plugins/synth-order.txt. plus_flows.sh reads the list as drawn afterwards
# (UISHOT_TRACE_ORDER): the edit rows ACD|FAT|VAP|-WTFM|-DIRT|PERC|CHIP, then the Model list WTFM|ACD|FAT|VAP|PERC|CHIP: DIRT is gone,
# WTFM is hidden but stays at the top because Synth 1 plays it (the MK66 rules, docs/synth_order.md).
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini
title: Synth order on the Mini (P12)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Right
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1200ms
press Shift
wait 300ms
tap F1
wait 300ms
release Shift
wait 600ms
expect text "Edit list"
tap Down
wait 300ms
press Shift
wait 300ms
tap Down
wait 300ms
release Shift
wait 400ms
tap Up
wait 300ms
tap Delete
wait 400ms
tap Up
wait 300ms
tap Delete
wait 600ms
shot order-edit
tap F1
wait 600ms
expect text "Model"
shot order-after
